      "originalTitle": "የቡና ነጋዴ",
      "synopsis": "A gripping tale of ambition, tradition, and family set against the backdrop of Ethiopia's coffee trade. When young entrepreneur Selam inherits her grandfather's struggling coffee business, she must navigate ruthless competitors, family expectations, and her own dreams of modernizing the trade.",
